Secondly, I am stuck with how to partition the data according to my hypotheses (which I give below) for partition.gp <http://partition.gp>.

Hypos    Seg1    Seg2    Seg3    Seg4    Seg5
H1    2    1    1    1    1
H2    2    2    1    1    3
H3    1    1    2    3    3
H4    1    2    3    4    5

Sorry for the rookie questions - Any help would be appreciated.

Cheers
Jon

