Thank you Prof. Dean for the answer. Just a follow-up Q. Is there a lower limited on the number of landmarks that should be included in PLS?

A sample code to illustrate my question here:

require(Morpho) #for gorf.dat data (8 landmarks, 2D, 30 specimens)
library(shapes)
library(geomorph)

proc <- procSym(gorf.dat)
dim(proc$rotated)
